  - Target: CANCER TREATMENT
  - Description: Screening is needed because some cancer treatments can reactivate hepatitis B or hepatitis C and cause liver damage.
  - Source: HEPATITIS B AND HEPATITIS C SCREENING
  - Target: TREATMENT TEAM
  - Description: The hepatitis blood test tells the treatment team whether the patient has or had hepatitis B or C.</data>
