  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests are used to target treatment and determine prognosis
  - Source: GENETIC AND BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Target: GENETIC TESTS
  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests include genetic tests to learn about the AML subtype
  - Source: GENETIC AND BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Target: SYSTEMIC THERAPY
  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests are used to target systemic therapy for the patient's subtype of AML.
  - Source: GENETIC AND BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Target: TARGETED THERAPY
  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests help guide targeted therapy for AML
  - Source: ACUTE MYELOID LEUKEMIA
  - Target: GENETIC AND BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests are used to learn about the AML subtype, target treatment, and determine prognosis
  - Source: GENETIC AND BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Target: PROGNOSIS
  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests help determine the likely course of the cancer, called a prognosis
  - Source: GENETIC AND BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Target: BIOMARKER TESTS
  - Description: Genetic and biomarker tests include biomarker tests to target treatment</data>
