    <node id="LIVER FUNCTION TESTS">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">Liver function tests are blood tests that measure chemicals and enzymes made or processed by the liver. These tests are used to assess overall liver health and to check the condition of the bile ducts. Abnormal levels of these substances may indicate liver damage or, in some cases, the spread of cancer to the liver.
