  - Description: The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) provides guidelines that include a chapter on BCR::ABL1-negative or BCR::ABL1-like B-ALL, which is identified as the most common type of B-ALL. The NCCN Guidelines for Patients also contain a chapter specifically addressing treatment for BCR::ABL1-negative or BCR::ABL1-like B-ALL, offering patient-focused information on managing this condition.</data>
