    <node id="CHRONIC MYELOID LEUKEMIA">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">Chronic myeloid leukemia (CML) is the disease process discussed in the text; it is caused by the BCR::ABL1 gene, characterized by the Philadelphia chromosome, and the text covers testing, treatment, and care for it.
Relationships:
  - Source: CHRONIC MYELOID LEUKEMIA
