    <edge source="TEST RESULTS" target="TREATMENT PLANNING" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">TEST RESULTS play a critical role in TREATMENT PLANNING, as they are used to determine the appropriate course of care for a patient. Specifically, test results derived from a patient's medical history, physical examination, imaging studies, and biopsy collectively inform and guide the treatment plan. In this way, comprehensive diagnostic information is synthesized to ensure that treatment decisions are based on a thorough evaluation of the patient's condition.</data>
      <data key="d8">TEST RESULTS</data>
    </edge>
