      <data key="d8">ABDOMINOPERINEAL RESECTION (APR)</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ABDOMINOPERINEAL RESECTION (APR)" target="GROIN DISSECTION" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A groin dissection is performed during APR if groin lymph nodes are known to contain cancer</data>
      <data key="d8">ABDOMINOPERINEAL RESECTION (APR)</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ABDOMINOPERINEAL RESECTION (APR)" target="MUSCLE FLAP RECONSTRUCTION" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Muscle flap reconstruction can improve healing of the perineum and reduce complications after APR</data>
      <data key="d8">ABDOMINOPERINEAL RESECTION (APR)</data>
    </edge>
