      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The NCCN Guidelines mention non-Hodgkin lymphoma when explaining Burkitt lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d8">NATIONAL COMPREHENSIVE CANCER NETWORK</data>
    </edge>
